{% extends 'site/guideBase.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-header">Research</div>
        <div class="uw-card-body">
            <p>
                Research allows you to unlock new technologies, advanced unit types, and special operations for your empire.
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>Research costs <b>cash</b> and takes time to complete.</li>
                <li>You can only have <b>one active research</b> at a time.</li>
                <li>Some research can be <b>upgraded to higher levels</b>; each level has its own cost and duration. You research the next level by upgrading the same technology.</li>
                <li>Higher levels of a research may require other technologies to also reach a minimum level (e.g. Special Operations level 3 requires Research level 3).</li>
                <li>You can <b>cancel</b> an in-progress research; the cost is not refunded.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                For a full list of available research and their requirements, see the <a href="{{ url('Guide/ListResearch') }}">Research List</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
